  "title": "Spacecraft Market - AstroForge",
  "summary": "In 2023, the global spacecraft market was valued at $6.9 billion and is projected to grow at a compound annual growth rate (CAGR) of 5.7% from 2024 to 2033. This growth is driven by key factors such as the rapid expansion of small satellite constellations (networks of satellites that work together in orbit) and the increasing role of commercial space ventures, both of which are fueling innovation and opening new market opportunities.",
